<reasoning_effort>
{% if effort == "none" -%}
Answer directly without rehearsing reasoning first.
{% elif effort == "minimal" -%}
Think briefly before answering; one short internal step is enough.
{% elif effort == "low" -%}
Think briefly before answering: confirm what is asked and pick a direct approach.
{% elif effort == "medium" -%}
Reason step by step before answering: state assumptions, work through the problem, then give the answer.
{% elif effort == "high" -%}
Reason carefully and thoroughly before answering: lay out the problem, consider edge cases and failure modes, verify your conclusions, then answer.
{% endif -%}
{% if verbosity == "low" -%}
Keep the final answer concise and compact.
{% elif verbosity == "medium" -%}
Keep the final answer moderately detailed.
{% elif verbosity == "high" -%}
Keep the final answer detailed and thorough.
{% endif -%}
</reasoning_effort>
